WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.978 --> 00:00:01.811
(whooshing noise)

00:00:01.811 --> 00:00:04.951
(squeaking)

00:00:04.951 --> 00:00:05.878
- So it's lunchtime in New York City,

00:00:05.878 --> 00:00:08.447
and I just heard about this
burger place that sells

00:00:08.447 --> 00:00:11.401
one of, if not, the biggest
burger in New York City.

00:00:11.401 --> 00:00:13.502
So I figured I'd grab a few friends

00:00:13.502 --> 00:00:15.691
and see if we're able to finish it.

00:00:15.691 --> 00:00:16.524
- Hey!

00:00:16.524 --> 00:00:17.357
- Hey!

00:00:17.357 --> 00:00:18.190
What's up?

00:00:19.724 --> 00:00:21.416
- So this is Clinton Hall,

00:00:21.416 --> 00:00:25.176
and they have a burger
challenge that is huge.

00:00:25.176 --> 00:00:27.155
There's fries and a beer,

00:00:27.155 --> 00:00:28.727
and you have to finish all of it.

00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:31.347
- Wait, I didn't know about
the fries and beer! What?

00:00:31.347 --> 00:00:33.102
- I'm really excited about the fries!

00:00:33.102 --> 00:00:35.193
- You also have to do it in 25 minutes.

00:00:35.193 --> 00:00:36.623
- Ooh.

00:00:36.623 --> 00:00:39.795
- I personally do not
care about the 25 minutes.

00:00:39.795 --> 00:00:42.888
All I care about is that
I can eat more than you.

00:00:42.888 --> 00:00:45.846
- I think I'm gonna win
this, guys, I'm not lying.

00:00:45.846 --> 00:00:48.144
- I would be shocked if
she beats either one of us.

00:00:48.144 --> 00:00:49.278
- You've seen me eat!

00:00:49.278 --> 00:00:51.652
- Why can't you just invite
us to normal lunches?

00:00:51.652 --> 00:00:52.485
- Yeah.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:55.152
(blues-y music)

00:01:01.554 --> 00:01:02.676
- I take back everything I said,

00:01:02.676 --> 00:01:03.509
all of it.

00:01:03.509 --> 00:01:04.342
Everything.

00:01:04.342 --> 00:01:05.379
- What?

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:07.475
This is why I didn't make
any bold statements earlier

00:01:07.475 --> 00:01:09.504
like this girl here.

00:01:09.504 --> 00:01:11.587
- You know you want this.

00:01:14.086 --> 00:01:16.049
- Alright, so there are literally,

00:01:16.049 --> 00:01:18.131
just burgers on this thing.

00:01:18.131 --> 00:01:19.608
- Yeah, yeah. Full on.

00:01:19.608 --> 00:01:21.358
- It's three burgers,

00:01:22.468 --> 00:01:24.418
three big burgers,

00:01:24.418 --> 00:01:26.093
stacked on top of each other.

00:01:26.093 --> 00:01:29.609
- Mm. This is like juicy, fatty burgers.

00:01:29.609 --> 00:01:31.072
I can feel my arteries just slowly

00:01:31.072 --> 00:01:32.865
closing up on me.

00:01:32.865 --> 00:01:34.752
- Mine are opening up and
being like, yeah, come on!

00:01:34.752 --> 00:01:35.593
(laughing)

00:01:35.593 --> 00:01:37.734
- Been waiting all day!

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:39.406
- I just finished the
first one before you guys.

00:01:39.406 --> 00:01:40.449
- Oh, okay, wait.

00:01:40.449 --> 00:01:41.688
- Do I get a prize?

00:01:41.688 --> 00:01:44.842
- So Rob, right now,
is at the winning pace.

00:01:44.842 --> 00:01:46.965
Insert shot of the pizza challenge.

00:01:46.965 --> 00:01:48.980
- I have such a head start on you.

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:50.264
- You heard it here first.

00:01:50.264 --> 00:01:51.881
- Nope.

00:01:51.881 --> 00:01:53.220
Now that I'm kind of getting into it

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:55.198
I'm feeling my confidence is coming back.

00:01:55.198 --> 00:01:56.513
- You're doing pretty good, though.

00:01:56.513 --> 00:01:58.017
- (with mouth full) Hey, nope.

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:58.967
(all laughing)

00:01:58.967 --> 00:01:59.800
- Cheater!

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:00.781
- No!

00:02:00.781 --> 00:02:01.920
- You know what,

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:03.497
normally I eat over the sink,

00:02:03.497 --> 00:02:04.904
or in sweatpants, but

00:02:04.904 --> 00:02:06.618
(record skipping noise)

00:02:06.618 --> 00:02:07.646
- Do you live in jail?

00:02:07.646 --> 00:02:09.570
(all laughing)

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:10.517
- Yes.

00:02:10.517 --> 00:02:11.911
- I'm still feelin' good.

00:02:11.911 --> 00:02:13.226
I'm starting to slow down.

00:02:13.226 --> 00:02:17.299
But the fries are gonna
be difficult, I think.

00:02:17.299 --> 00:02:19.110
- Can't really think anymore.

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:20.910
I might start crying.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:22.158
(laughs)

00:02:22.158 --> 00:02:23.870
- Nobody will beat me today.

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:26.437
Sure as hell not this one.

00:02:26.437 --> 00:02:27.620
- Just wait, though.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:28.987
It might be like the
tortoise and the hare.

00:02:28.987 --> 00:02:29.877
You're powering through.

00:02:29.877 --> 00:02:30.710
- Do you think that?

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.165
Do you believe that?

00:02:32.165 --> 00:02:33.284
See, she doesn't believe that.

00:02:33.284 --> 00:02:35.371
- (with mouth full) Aw,
that's so good, this is it.

00:02:35.371 --> 00:02:36.672
- No.

00:02:36.672 --> 00:02:39.338
- It's the third burger.

00:02:39.338 --> 00:02:42.088
(chewing noises)

00:02:43.282 --> 00:02:46.282
(downtrodden music)

00:02:47.252 --> 00:02:48.703
- Slowing.

00:02:48.703 --> 00:02:50.337
I'm sure some people out there could

00:02:50.337 --> 00:02:51.583
probably finish this all

00:02:51.583 --> 00:02:52.959
and Christian just might, but

00:02:52.959 --> 00:02:55.488
there's a lot of fries here.

00:02:55.488 --> 00:02:58.229
(sighs)

00:02:58.229 --> 00:03:01.550
- Ooh, I'm hurt. Feelin' it. (laughs)

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:04.550
(downtrodden music)

00:03:05.492 --> 00:03:07.333
- So I think we've all maxed out

00:03:07.333 --> 00:03:08.813
at where we are.

00:03:08.813 --> 00:03:10.307
- Loser again.

00:03:10.307 --> 00:03:11.654
- I have fries.

00:03:11.654 --> 00:03:13.261
I did a dent in the fries,

00:03:13.261 --> 00:03:14.677
though it might not look like it.

00:03:14.677 --> 00:03:17.293
- I ate two whole burgers.

00:03:17.293 --> 00:03:18.126
- What's this?

00:03:18.126 --> 00:03:20.470
- Shh, shh, don't!

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:21.599
He put that there.

00:03:21.599 --> 00:03:22.860
Stop!

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.185
(laughing)

00:03:24.185 --> 00:03:25.332
- What have you hidden under the fries?!

00:03:25.332 --> 00:03:26.619
- Nevermind!

00:03:26.619 --> 00:03:29.918
- You literally buried it like a cat.

00:03:29.918 --> 00:03:30.940
(laughing)

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:33.455
- To the Clinton Hall Challenge,

00:03:33.455 --> 00:03:35.471
for getting the better of all of us.

00:03:35.471 --> 00:03:36.712
- Yes.

00:03:36.712 --> 00:03:37.545
- Yeah.

00:03:37.545 --> 00:03:38.749
- Should we pour one out for the homies?

00:03:38.749 --> 00:03:39.832
- No, cheers!

00:03:40.685 --> 00:03:42.935
(laughing)

00:03:43.911 --> 00:03:46.661
(chewing noises)

00:03:48.011 --> 00:03:49.761
- How does video end?

00:03:51.241 --> 00:03:53.443
- With me dying in my food.

00:03:53.443 --> 00:03:54.481
Goodbye, summer bod.

00:03:54.481 --> 00:03:55.878
- Goodbye, yeah, I mean it's,

00:03:55.878 --> 00:03:57.515
I'm not gonna be in a bikini.

00:03:57.515 --> 00:03:59.923
Not in this BuzzFeed video.

00:03:59.923 --> 00:04:02.173
